  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core contribution to the United Nations Children&apos;s Fund (UNICEF) for the years 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unearmarked multi-annual core contribution  (ongeoormerkte  meerjarige kernbijdrage) to the United Nations Children&apos;s Fund (UNICEF) for the years 2023-2025. This is a contribution to support the implementation of the UNICEF Strategic Plan for the years 2023, 2024 and 2025, in line with the Dutch commitments under the UN Funding Compact. The contribution in this budget is a total of EUR 132 million (EUR 44 million per year), of which the Funding Compact increase is subject to parliamentary approval.</narrative>
  </description>
